repository-code: "https://github.com/IvanLopezFlores/AccessTex"

abstract: >-
  AccessTex is an accessible LaTeX editor and compiler designed to support
  users with visual disabilities, particularly screen-reader users. It
  provides keyboard-centered interaction, document-structure navigation,
  accessible compilation feedback, interpretation of common LaTeX errors,
  and localization of the probable error line.

keywords:
  - LaTeX
  - accessibility
  - visual disability
  - screen reader
  - assistive technology
  - NVDA
  - accessible software
